{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfad Assassins Arena \u2013 Deception in Motion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652570/extras/90fad783e486287d2b97222b91147e4e.avif?t=1773984358\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assassins Arena is a multiplayer social deduction game where players blend in, complete tasks, and secretly eliminate each other \u2014 all in real-time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone looks the same.<br>Anyone could be the killer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call meetings, discuss with other players, and vote to eliminate suspects\u2026 before it\u2019s too late.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 Core Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652570/extras/c0511f89a7cae426b6b2a6f8d9c6003e.poster.avif?t=1773984358\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652570/extras/c0511f89a7cae426b6b2a6f8d9c6003e.webm?t=1773984358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652570/extras/c0511f89a7cae426b6b2a6f8d9c6003e.mp4?t=1773984358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blend In</strong><br>Move naturally and avoid suspicion while hiding your true identity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Tasks</strong><br>Interact with stations across the map to contribute \u2014 or fake your intentions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eliminate Players</strong><br>If you are the killer, take out others without being seen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Report &amp; Call Meetings</strong><br>Find bodies or trigger emergency meetings to start discussions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discuss &amp; Vote</strong><br>Analyze behavior, accuse others, defend yourself, and vote players out.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652570/extras/a21b87c5bfc1dc33b1d8b6344b062927.poster.avif?t=1773984358\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652570/extras/a21b87c5bfc1dc33b1d8b6344b062927.webm?t=1773984358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652570/extras/a21b87c5bfc1dc33b1d8b6344b062927.mp4?t=1773984358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Social deduction gameplay with meetings and voting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time movement (no grid-based system)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Task system with interactive minigames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden roles and deception mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer (2\u20138 players)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice communication support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single Player mode with AI</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2696\ufe0f Roles &amp; Mind Games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652570/extras/eead28efce4c3a00790823ae16028be1.avif?t=1773984358\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Killers</strong><br>Blend in, fake tasks, and eliminate players silently.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survivors</strong><br>Complete objectives and identify suspicious behavior.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no clear indicators.<br>Only actions reveal the truth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d Dynamic Environment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652570/extras/1aeedd857bbfeb27f3a3bb7dceb06775.avif?t=1773984358\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps filled with interactive elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players and NPC-like behavior blend together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match creates new situations and mind games</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcac Developer Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This update transforms Assassins Arena into a full social deduction experience, combining real-time gameplay with deception, strategy, and player interaction.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3652570?t=1773984358","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3652570?t=1773984358","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652570/047bf8049f6e439e73459c8cc9e5ba9ded401181/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773984358","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652570/047bf8049f6e439e73459c8cc9e5ba9ded401181/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773984358","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfad Assassins Arena \u2013 Deception in Motio